"# 4.11.0 — 2026-09-11\n\n27 pull requests merged since 4.10.3 (a-intel/platform only; a-intel/mobile ships separately this cycle).\n\n## Features\n- Run tokens carry a delegation ceiling; a call above it is parked, never denied silently (#478)\n- `oxagen runs export` writes a signed bundle with the verifier script alongside (#480)\n- Context recall reports its budget per provider (#474)\n- Kill switches gained a deny generation, visible in every later decision (#469)\n- Mission Control shows a run's cost basis next to the number (#472)\n\n## Breaking\n- `policy.decide` no longer returns allow for an untainted call with no matching rule; the default is approve (#481)\n- `frame.kind` value `tool_call` is renamed `tool.call` in exports (#479)\n\n## Fixes\n- Cache reads were mis-attributed when steering landed mid-conversation (#477)\n- `github__create_release` schema accepted an empty tag (#475)\n- Approval cards no longer expire early when the clock skews (#470)\n- Ledger rollups double-counted a retried model call (#468)"
